          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765782741324_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are generating Agentic App actions from the provided employee event data.\nInput: {{$context.$nodes.FINDMATCHINGEVENTS.$output.output}}\n\nProduction rules:\n- Use only the input data. Do not invent events, titles, dates, ids, or statuses.\n- Generate an action only when an event has EventNumber and RespondentStatusCode is not ORA_REGISTERED.\n- Action code must be REGISTERFOREVENT.\n- Payload actionCode must be register.\n- actionText must be Register.\n- followUpCommand must be exactly: ora.Invoke(\"REGISTERFOREVENT\", {\"actionCode\":\"register\",\"EventNumber\":\"<EventNumber>\"})\n- Replace <EventNumber> with the event's EventNumber from input.\n- Sort actionable events by nearest StartDate when available.\n- Mark priority true only for the top 40 percent of actionable events, rounded up, with a maximum of 2 priority actions.\n- Non-priority actions may be returned for the remaining actionable events.\n- If no actionable event exists, return no actions.\n\nEach action must contain only title, shortDescription, actionText, followUpCommand, and priority."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
