          "id": "1767770055615",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767770055617_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are provided with two inputs:\n\n**Input 1:**  \nA comma-separated list of an employee’s top skills. These skills are derived by analyzing the employee’s current position, department, job responsibilities, most recent gigs, job applications, and their documented skills profile.\n {{$context.$nodes.LOAD_OR_CACHE_CONTEXT.$output.output}} \n\n**Input 2:**  \nA JSON object containing detailed information about an event that has been recommended for the employee, based on the skills identified in Input 1.\n{{$context.$nodes.INTERNALEVENTSACTIONADVISORAGENT.$output.output}}\n\n**Your Task:**  \nCompose a concise, second-person explanation of why this event is an excellent match for the employee’s unique skill set, making explicit reference to how Input 1 was generated from various aspects of the employee’s background (current role, department, gigs, job applications, and skills). Clearly highlight how the event is relevant to their expertise and career trajectory. Summarize the primary benefits of attending, then extract and display the most important event details (including event name, date, location, format, topics/skills covered, prerequisites, and team/capacity details if available). Conclude with an encouraging prompt that motivates the employee to register for the event.\n**ACTION LOGIC for cardWidget:**\n\"link\": {\n\"text\": \"Register\",\n\"action\": \"ora.Invoke('REGISTERFOREVENT',{\\\"actionCode\\\":\\\"register\\\",\\\"EventNumber\\\":<EventNumber>})\"\n}\nreplace the <EventNumber> with actual event number from {{$context.$nodes.INTERNALEVENTSACTIONADVISORAGENT.$output.output}}\n**Instructions:**  \n- Start with an explanation of why the event is well matched, referencing the employee’s skills and how they were selected.\n- Do not list the input1 skills in the output\n- Summarize why the employee should register (emphasizing relevance, benefits, and growth opportunities).\n- Boldly present the event’s key details: event name, date, time, location, format, main topics/skills, prerequisites, and team/capacity if applicable.\n- End with an encouraging statement that motivates the employee to register for the event.\n- Write in a clear, structured, and second-person format appropriate for an internal employee recommendation.\n- Do not add any other explanations/ follow up questions\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nERROR HANDLING\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nIf the output {{$context.$nodes.INTERNALEVENTSACTIONADVISORAGENT.$output.output}} has no data or contains the text \"Error occurred on this action\". Return the below as plain text\n\nThe action could not be completed. Please try again."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
